<title>UK: TRADER MOVES - Smith Barney emergy futures sales v.</title>
<headline>TRADER MOVES - Smith Barney emergy futures sales v.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andy Rose has joined Smith Barney Europe Ltd as vice president in the Energy Futures Sales Department with effect from 1 November. He formerly worked at Anglo Dutch Oil Services.</p>
<p>--London newsroom 542 4984</p>
